Subject: [PATCH 11/14] OSD: direct audio, subtitle and video-angle buttons

Reorders the video OSD button row: direct audio, subtitle and video
stream selection buttons whose focus label shows the language name
mapped by mediainfo.py; drops the playlist, teletext, streams and 3D
buttons. Touches VideoOSD.xml and Variables.xml.
---
 media/buttons/video_angle.png                 | Bin 0 -> 800 bytes
 .../osd/fullscreen/buttons/settings-audio.png | Bin 0 -> 2487 bytes
 xml/Variables.xml                             |  13 ++++
 xml/VideoOSD.xml                              |  70 ++++++++----------
 4 files changed, 44 insertions(+), 39 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 media/buttons/video_angle.png
 create mode 100644 media/osd/fullscreen/buttons/settings-audio.png

